    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūwīlwa kūsaama Holebu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo īyī akabawīla ū Musa pye a Baisilaeli aho balī ng'witogolo, kū kīya ya mongo gwa Yolodani; hū kūhaya mu mbūga ya Alaba īyo yalī yilolile na sī ya Sufu, yalī īpīndiwe na sī ja Palani, Tofeli, Labani, Hezeloti, na Dizahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ī Holebu ū kūja ī Kadeeshi-balinea lūlīho lūgendo lwa shikū ikūmi na lūmò, ūlū ūbītīla nzīla ya kū lūgūlū lwa Seili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa makūmi anè lūshikū lwa kwandya lwa ng'weji gwa ikūmi na gūmò, ū Musa akabawīla a Baisilaeli pyī ī mihayo īyo SEEBA walī wanagīīla kūlwa nguno yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo walī wamala kūmpyena ntemi Sihoni wa Baamoli, ūyo wikalaga Heshiboni; na Ogi ntemi wa Bashani, ūyo wikalaga Ashitaloti; ū ng'wene ūmpyenela ipandī lya Edilei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa aho alībahelela ī mihayo ya shilagīlo shenīshi, baalī bataalī kū nkīlo gwa kīya ya mongo gwa Yolodani. Ūbawīla alīhaya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū SEEBA Mulungu wise akatūwīla aho tūlī Holebu gīkī, ‘Lyang'wigelile lūūlū ī likanza īlo ng'wikalile a ha lūgūlū lwenūūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambūlagi ī ng'hambī ng'wīnge ho, muje kū sī ya magūlya ya Baamoli; muje mukūsambaalaga hose pye ū mu sī ja banhū abo balī hihī hihī ū ng'witogolo lya Alaba, ī sī ja malūgūlū, nī jijo jilī hihī hihī nū lūgūlū, nī litogolo lya Negevu, nī ja kūjīlīīla kū mbalama ya nyanza, kū sī ya Bakanani, na Lebanoni, kūjīlīīla kū mongo ntaale, ū gwa Flaati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managi gīkī ī sī yenīyī ying'we, nang'winhile bing'we. Na lūūlū shikīīlagi mo, ng'wīdime ī sī īyo SEEBA wabisagīja babyaji bing'we, ba Abulahamu, Isaka na Yakobo, na būbyīlye wabo ūbo būliza hanuma yabo.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūsolwa kwa batongeeji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo nakamuwīla, “Mulī bingī no mukūnilemeela ū kūmusuga nene iyene dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we wang'ongegije no, kūshisha ī haha mulī bingī gītī sonda ja ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū SEEBA Mulungu wa babyaji bing'we ni ang'ongejage mukwīle ng'hangala mashihūmbī na mashihūmbī, hama amufuuhe gīt'ūmo kwisagīja kwakwe kūlī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nene iyene dūhū gīkī, nakūdūla kinehe ū kwiyūmīlīja nabo ū būdito wa makoye ging'we, nī yombo ying'we? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū solagi kūfuma ū mu ng'anda jing'we banhū ba masala na bitegeleja, abo bigelelilwe kūkūjiwa; nabatūūle kūbiza bataale bing'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ning'we mukanishokeja mulīhaya, “Ū mhayo ūyo ūlītūwīla gwenūyo gūlī gwawiza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū mu ng'anda jing'we nūbasolanhya abo baalī ba masala na bitegeleja, abo baalī bigelelilwe kūkūjiwa, būbiza batongeeji. A benabo hū nūbatūūla kūbiza bataale bing'we, būbiza batongeeji ba mabità ga banhū shihūmbī shihūmbī, na banhū igana igana, na makūmi atano tano, na kaya ikūmi ikūmi. Hū būbiza benabo a bataale ba ng'anda jing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo nūbawīla a balamuji bing'we, “Ng'wīdegeleka ī mihayo ya baana ba ng'wing'we, ng'wabalamula mu būtūngīlīja pye a bose; nūūlū būbiza ū wilemeelwa būlī hagatī ya Baisilaeli na Baisilaeli, nūūlū ha gatī ya Baisilaeli na balobeji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūtūūla būsolanhya ū mu kalamulīle; ng'ūbadegeleka pye a banhū, bado na bataale. Yaya ū kūbasolanhya, hama yaya kūng'ogoha munhū nūūlū ūmò, nguno ū būlamuji būlī bo ng'wa Mulungu. Ūlū mhayo gūbiza ndito ū kūbing'we, nenhelagi nene nakūgūdegeleka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ī likanza lyenīlo nakamuwīla pyī ī mihayo īyo īng'wigelelilwe kwīyīta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mihayo ya kūtūng'wa kwa badati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū tūkalwandya ū lūgendo lwise gīt'ūmo SEEBA Mulungu wise walī watūlagīīlīla; tūbūūka kwīng'ū kū lūgūlū lwa Holebu, tūshimīza kūjīlīīla kū sī ya magūlya ga Baamoli. Tūkabītīla ū ng'witogolo ī ligalī īlo mukalībona ī lya kogohya, hū tūūkashika ī Kadeeshi-balinea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūn'ū nene nūmuwīla, “Ī haha lūūlū ng'washika ū mu sī ya Baamoli ī ya magūlya, īyo SEEBA Mulungu wise alītwinha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managi gīkī, ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we wang'winhile ī sī yenīyī, na lūūlū jagi mo mukīdime ībize ying'we gīt'ūmo SEEBA Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji bing'we wamuwīlīla kūfuma kale. Mutizogoha, yaya nūūlū kwiganīlīja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo pye a bose mukiza ng'ūniwīla, “Ī gete tūtūme ko banhū tame batonge bakīdate ī sī, batwenhele ī mhola ja nzīla īyo ītwigelelilwe kūbītīla, nī mizengo īyo tūlīkashikīla twīmane ūmo īlī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyo gūkabiza gwawiza ū kūlī nene, na lūūlū nūsolanhya banhū ikūmi na babīlī ū mu bing'we, munhū ūmò kūfuma būlī lūganda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būja būūkashika ū kū sī ya magūlya, būkatulumenha na kwilago lya Eshikooli, būlībona ūmo lyalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būsola na matwajo gamò na gamò ga kūfuma kwenūko, būtwenhela ī mhola ja kwenūko balīhaya, “Ī sī īyo alītwinha ū SEEBA Mulungu wise īlī yawiza no.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlemeelwa kwa Baisilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo mukalema ū kūja, ng'ūshilema ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muyūduguma ū mu maheema ging'we mulīhaya, “Ī get'ū SEEBA gashi atatūtogilwe, watwīngije ī Misili ūtwenha mu makono ga Baamoli kwiza kūtūmala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūje halī lūūlū ī haha, īkī a badūgū bise batūgwisha ng'holò gīko? Balītūwīla gīkī, ‘A ming'wana genayo galī na nguzu no, hangī malīhu no kūtūtinda a bise kūle kūle. Nī mizengo nayo mitaale no, īpīndīlījiwe ndugu ndīhu kūshisha kwilunde. Nīyo twagabonile ko na ming'wana ga shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Anaki!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nūmuwīla nūhaya, “Bing'we mutilalīlage gīko, yaya ū kūbogoha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we ūyo alītonga kū būtongi wing'we hū ng'wene akūmulwīlīīla, gīt'ūmo akītīla dūhū ū mu sī ya Misili mulolile gīkī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū kwitogolo nū kwene mukabona ūmo akamubūūkīj'ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, gīt'ūmo myaji akamūūkījaga ng'wana wakwe; hū ūmo akang'wītīla hose pye kūshisha ng'ūshika ī lipandī īlī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nūūlū īkī nakahaya gīko, nahene mutansanije ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo wamutongeelaga pye a makanza ū mu lūgendo lwing'we; ī būjikū watūmamīlaga būpe wa moto, ī līīmi ilunde. Wajaga akūmukoobelaga mapandī ga kūtūūla ng'hambī, na kūng'oolekeja ī nzīla īyo yalī īng'wigelelilwe kwībītīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū SEEBA aho wigwa īyo mukīhaya, akapelana no kūshisha wilahīla alīhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Atīho munhū nūūlū ūmò ū mu shibyalīlwe shabūbi īshi, ūyo akwībona ī sī yawiza īyo naabilahīlīla kūbinha bakūlūgenji bing'we; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūlū atī Kelebu dūhū, ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yefune. Ū ng'wenūyo akwībona, nīyo ī sī īyo mhambala jakwe jīpandile nakūng'winha ū wei nī shibyalīlwe shakwe, nguno akūshimīzaga hamò na SEEBA mu ng'holò īmò.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū SEEBA akanipelanīla nū nene kūlwa nguno ying'we; ūniwīla, “Nū bebe ūtingīla ū mu sī yenīyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alīyo ū ngunanhi wako ū Yoshwa ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nuni hū ng'wene ūyo akūshika mo. Ntimbyage ng'holò, nguno hū ng'wene akūbatongeela a Baisilaeli bashikīīle mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bado bado abo ng'wabahayaga gīkī bakūsolwa nding'wa, a bana bing'we abo bataalī kūmana kwīlekanya ī yawiza nī yabūbi, a benabo hū bene abo bakwingīla ū mu sī yenīyo. Nakūbinha bīdime ībize yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bing'we, ī haha galūkagi mudime nzīla ya kūja kwitogolo lya kūjīlīīla kū nyanza yaza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mihayo ya kūpyenwa kwa Baisilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a bing'we mukashosha mulīhaya, “Twang'hūbag'ū SEEBA. Tūkūja tūkalwe ū būlūgū gīt'ūmo SEEBA Mulungu wise watūlagīīlīla.” Na ng'hana būlī ūmò wing'we ūbūūcha shilanga shakwe, mukwiganikaga gīkī gūlī mhayo nogu ū kūlinha ko ū kū sī ya magūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA akaniwīla, “Bawīlage ‘Yaya ū kūja ko kūlwa būlūgū, nguno ū nene natūbiza hamò ning'we, bakūmupyena a banishi bing'we.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakamuwīla ī yenīyī alīyo ng'ūlema ū kūniigwa; ng'ūshilema ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA, ng'ūgagabala kūlinha ū kū sī ya magūlya yenīyo kūnū mukwigīmba gīmbaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baamoli abo bikalaga ū mu sī ya magūlya yenīyo būmusūng'wana, būmupeeja gītī mulīpeejiwa nzūkī; būja bakūmubūlagaga nzīla ngima kūfuma sī ya Seili kūshisha Holima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ūshoka ū kūlī SEEBA ng'wiza ng'wandya kūnīlīīla, alīyo nang'hwe wichibīja a matū gakwe, atamudegelekile ū kūlīla kwing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ng'wikala Kadeeshi shikū ningī, pyī ī shikū ījo mukikala ipandī lyenīlo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
